  "should_chunk": true,
  "strategy": "by_h1",
  "reason": "page_count>=threshold",
  "context_aware_level": "h1"
}
```
**Reasoning**: 
- Page count (24) >= threshold (10), so should_chunk=true
- Context aware level is "h1" (user chosen)
- Strategy becomes "by_h1" (derived from context_aware_level when should_chunk=true)
- Reason: "page_count>=threshold" because 24 >= 10

